        "text": "Micah Resnick",
        "text_sha256": "ad174303081549642173be9b7cc05e0d07cd69711d9506124815dfcbbb3940a7",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Micah Resnick, M.D., F.A.A.P.",
        "text_sha256": "91c3251fc5ffef4ccf277347ff61af9b3dfa8f2a4d81d7260952e77351a0863d",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "About Micah Resnick, M.D., F.A.A.P.",
        "text_sha256": "63f723e18abc76069e984c6e0851d2527b563edb992ab42b4221cd9a3bf0b3d7",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Resnick is a board-certified pediatrician in Cincinnati, Ohio, with TriHealth.",
        "text_sha256": "c00ecfcd457d4963f2116eeb42842b82e5671d1d122c7c24b985c7b9e081c982",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "After graduating from Brown University with a degree in Comparative Literature, Dr. Resnick studied medicine at Howard University in Washington, D.C. He then moved back to his hometown of New York City to complete his pediatric training at Children’s Hospital at Montefiore in the Bronx, New York.",
        "text_sha256": "09eefbb43717066f918a9c36ce19cd54dfdacf7ab03c8c5d5e19283971b418ce",
        "word_count": 47
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Board certifications",
        "text_sha256": "b6ebfd0050d34a00e27b7a07eb958e6520d9d8c003bea281b96762ad17883d6b",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Resnick is board-certified by the American Board of Pediatrics and is a Fellow of the American Academy of Pediatrics.",
        "text_sha256": "6ad9e1a93ae7a8793295f7d9053aa72fdda82ce60a62a30e86efa1e574c5adbe",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Hospital affiliations",
        "text_sha256": "e6504e68d7e8e6b8187bc1b13e33b31f751fb7b365b27cf9f90691053f642ba2",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Resnick is affiliated with Bethesda North Hospital and Good Samaritan Hospital.",
        "text_sha256": "127b79627a67ebeab41008c237309d387f05183d8b252ba8f84b77558e9c2a7d",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other relevant positions",
        "text_sha256": "3cb35bf4b505f1c9652a309bbf062b6c5ebff2ba01239bd968b9ac137f401f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Resnick is a member of the Ohio Chapter of the American Academy of Pediatrics. Most importantly, Dr. Resnick is a lucky husband and blessed father of three incredible kids — Lana, Eli and Sidney.",
        "text_sha256": "c860afcd811fe796d9066eb3f47fff477cadf474690d747bb4da46e5dd1db4c8",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Opens a new window",
        "text_sha256": "52b71e1a64c4aa4703a246e34de17b242088e4863ab032b365c12e07d7964633",
        "word_count": 4
      }
    ],
